  Layer       : 1
  Category    : Partitioning Strategy → Partition Pruning
  Similarity  : 0.4995
  Title       : Ensure queries use partition pruning to avoid full table scans
  Problem     : Queries on partitioned tables that do not filter on the partition key scan all partitions, negating the performance and cost benefits of partitioning entirely.
  Strategy    : Ensure all queries on partitioned tables include a filter on the partition key in the WHERE clause, and avoid applying functions or type casts to the partition column that prevent partition elimination.
  Conditions  : []
---
